# WM_COMMAND routing (UIF-920, UIF-722)
ok menu code 0: item clicked
ok accelerator code 1: item clicked
ok nested item
ok command entry on the bar (UIF-725)
ok disabled item: no click
ok id of an item outside the menu: nothing
ok LParam <> 0 is not a menu command
ok LParam = 0 at a child window: not routed (UIF-072)
ok LParam = 0 at the form: routed (UIF-072)
ok FindItem by command
ok FindItem: id 0 is none
ok DispatchCommand: unknown id
# WM_INITMENUPOPUP (UIF-723)
ok three entries before
ok owning item's OnClick first
ok the handler's change is in the native menu
ok FindItem by handle
ok nested sub-menu: its item's OnClick
ok window menu flag: not a menu of ours
ok pop-up entry clicked by id
# DrawMenuBar after a rebuild (UIF-720)
ok bar entry changed: menu bar redrawn
ok bar item added: menu bar redrawn
ok bar has the new entry
ok nested change: no menu bar redraw
ok detached menu: no redraw of the former form
ok without Menu the form routes nothing
